note right of UC01
 Owner ID is a stable system-generated identifier,
 independent from required phone number.
 No owner self-registration.
end note
note right of UC11O
 SRS FR-11.10: authenticated owner sees only
 AVAILABLE intervals and clinic phone.
 Existing OpenAPI publishes BUSY/CLOSED publicly.
 Contract revision pending.
end note
note right of UC12V
 No owner online booking.
 Active appointment overlap: reject.
 Outside normal working hours: warning plus
 explicit vet confirmation permitted if no overlap.
end note
note right of UC14
 Show after successful initial password change.
 Four steps: My Pets, Health Diary, Health Records,
 Vaccinations & Reminders. Next / Back / Skip;
 Completed/Skipped persisted per account.
 Replay must not reset stored status.
end note
note bottom of UC08
 New 69-page SRS repeats section 3.7 and
 does not contain a separate US-08 section.
 Sprint 1 interpretation retained as provisional
 until Product Owner corrects the SRS.
end note
note bottom of UC03
 Cross-cutting SERVER-side authorization,
 not a permission editing screen.
end note
